[
  {
    "name": "city_search_metrics",
    "description": "【城市基础数据与魅力指数】发现指标或产品版本。指标搜索支持名称/别名及主题的轻量模糊匹配；search_match标识相关或主题候选，须按正式名称、单位和定义选择metric_id，不代表同一口径。默认返回定义、单位、频率、首末期、来源和产品归属；逐期覆盖与缺口须传 include_periods=true。catalog_scope 明确栏目：statistics 城市数据字典、charm 城市魅力指数、industry 产业产品、all 全库。availability 区分当前可查、需产品版本和仅有定义，目录命中不等于可查。介绍目录优先 view=summary，汇总全部匹配范围的分类与状态。catalog=products 返回产品版本、方法、地点组与事实覆盖，此模式不接受period；年份放query或用已发现的product_version_id。取得版次后，完整节点和城市数值直接query(places, product_version_id)。按product_version_id筛指标返回节点绑定批次、统计期和方法。tags使用标签码，tag_match=any/all。limit最多50，用next_offset翻页。默认完整保留记录并对重复元数据无损去重；metadata_help说明$ref共享字典和$table年度表的展开规则。原嵌套格式用response_format=full，分页不变。",
    "inputSchema": {
      "properties": {
        "query": {
          "default": "",
          "title": "Query",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "theme": {
          "default": "",
          "title": "Theme",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "level": {
          "default": "",
          "title": "Level",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "period": {
          "default": "",
          "title": "Period",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "metric_kind": {
          "default": "",
          "title": "Metric Kind",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "product_id": {
          "default": "",
          "title": "Product Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "product_version_id": {
          "default": "",
          "title": "Product Version Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "catalog": {
          "default": "",
          "enum": [
            "",
            "metrics",
            "products"
          ],
          "title": "Catalog",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "catalog_scope": {
          "default": "all",
          "enum": [
            "all",
            "statistics",
            "charm",
            "industry"
